# Not produced by the documented invocations, checked 2026-08-28: both Python
# programs here (packages/example-app/level-two/run_level_two.py and
# rust/matrix-crypto-core/tests/interop/nio_party.py) are run as scripts and
# import nothing local, and CPython does not cache __main__. Ignored anyway,
# because the day one of them grows a helper module, or someone runs pytest,
# is not the day to notice.
__pycache__/
# `npm pack` writes the tarball next to package.json unless told otherwise,
# and this one is 70 MB of prebuilt binaries. scripts/rehearse-publish.sh and
# the release workflow both pack into a temporary directory precisely so they
# never leave one here, but a hand-run `npm pack` while debugging a release
# does, and a 70 MB accidental commit is not undone by a revert.
*.tgz
